@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Say hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello

### Draw six loto numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/loto

### Draw ten sets of six loto numbers, one draw per line
GET {{baseUrl}}/loto/10?format=text

### Draw ten sets of six loto numbers as JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/loto/10

### Ask the magic 8 ball
GET {{baseUrl}}/8ball
